{"corpus":"ccc","number":1504,"text_html":"<span>Souvent Jésus<sup class=\"srcRef cccRef\">§696</sup> demande aux malades de croire <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"1\">1</sup><sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"2\">2</sup><sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"3\">3</sup>. Il se sert de signes pour guérir : salive et imposition des mains <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"4\">4</sup><sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"5\">5</sup>, boue et ablution <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"6\">6</sup>. Les malades cherchent à le toucher <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"7\">7</sup><sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"8\">8</sup><sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"9\">9</sup> « car une force sortait de lui qui les guérissait tous » <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"10\">10</sup>. Ainsi, dans les sacrements, le Christ continue à nous « toucher » pour nous guérir.</span>","cross_refs":["696"],"bible_refs":[{"text":"Mc 5:34"},{"text":"Mc 5:36"},{"text":"Mc 9:23"},{"text":"Mc 7:32-36"},{"text":"Mc 8:22-25"},{"text":"Jn 9:6"},{"text":"Mc 1:41"},{"text":"Mc 3:10"},{"text":"Mc 6:56"},{"text":"Lc 6:19"}],"citations":[],"magisterial_refs":[{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Mc 5:34","idx":1},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"5:36","idx":2},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"9:23","idx":3},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Mc 7:32-36","idx":4},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"8:22-25","idx":5},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Jn 9:6 s","idx":6},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Mc 1:41","idx":7},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"3:10","idx":8},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"6:56","idx":9},{"type":"bible","raw":"Lc 6:19","idx":10}]}